  "liner": {
   "body_md": "Mountain Goats performed a five-song session for KEXP Radio in Seattle on June 16, 2005 [1]. This audience recording captures the band playing \"The Mummy's Hand,\" \"You or Your Memory,\" \"Song for Dennis Brown,\" \"Dilaudid,\" and \"Deianara Crush\" [1]. The track \"The Mummy's Hand\" is the only archived performance of that song in the collection [1]. \"Deianara Crush\" is a rare appearance, with only five archived performances total, and this show marks the first in the archive for that specific song [1]. The session is show 72 of 467 in the archive's collection for the performer [2]. The previous archived show was on May 14, 2005, at NPR [2]. The recording is a 29-minute audience capture [1]. A blog post describes this as a KEXP Session in Seattle [3]. The setlist includes songs with specific archival statistics [2].",
